1	// Room "P2 ground bedroom" (interior designer's part): a 3 x 2 bedroom, box [36,2,19,38,4,20]. The bed is the focal
2	// piece, run north-south at x37: its head (37,2,19) against the partition at z18, its foot (37,2,20) against the south
3	// window pair. A bed along x cannot fit (the west wall x35 is a window, the east opening x39 is open), and bed() needs
4	// the two cells past the foot clear, so x37 is the only column that works. A barrel dresser with a lantern on its lid
5	// stands at the north-west corner; the x38 column and the cell past the foot stay clear, so the door at (38,18) walks
6	// to the bed. The lantern is standing (no ceiling block is built yet above y4).
7	import { B } from "/Volumes/ext1/swe/repos/minecraft-design/tools/src/build.mjs";
8	import { bedSet, dresser } from "../vocab.mjs";
